# CNG Station Management System — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values from THIS project's own dashboards.
# NEVER copy values from another project (see the isolation rule in CLAUDE.md).
# `.env.local` is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BROWSER-SAFE values only. Everything below is compiled into the client bundle
# and is visible to anyone using the app. That is acceptable ONLY for
# publishable identifiers.
#
# NEVER put any of these in a VITE_ variable, in this file, or anywhere in the
# repository:
#   * Supabase service-role key
#   * Supabase database password
#   * VAPID private key
# Those live in Supabase secrets and must never be shipped to the browser.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Supabase (project `cng-station-management`, its own organization) ---
# Project URL and publishable key. Both are browser-safe.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Enable only after the Google provider and redirect URLs are configured in Supabase.
VITE_ENABLE_GOOGLE_AUTH=false

# --- Web Push (this project's own VAPID key pair) ---
# PUBLIC key only. The private key is an Edge Function secret.
# Not used until the notification phase.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=

# --- App ---
VITE_APP_NAME=CNG Station Management
